TITLE 1D transport: Ca/Na exchange, 10 cells, 10 shifts; query CaX2 eq fraction at cell 1, step 6

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

EQUILIBRATE 1-10 with solution 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -time_step 1
    -punch_frequency 1
    -print_frequency 1
END

PRINT
    -exchange true
END
